WEBVTT

02:34.750 --> 02:38.210
The Power of

02:34.750 --> 02:38.210
Onikirimaru

02:45.690 --> 02:47.460
Onikirimaru...

02:48.030 --> 02:51.560
It's awakening from its thousand year sleep.

02:52.170 --> 02:53.800
It can't be.

02:59.310 --> 03:00.710
Monado.

03:00.710 --> 03:04.010
Shall I retrieve the Artifact first?

03:04.010 --> 03:05.450
Eins,

03:05.450 --> 03:07.280
go ahead.

03:07.280 --> 03:09.750
You retrieve the Artifact.

03:17.390 --> 03:18.560
Takuma!

03:18.560 --> 03:19.460
Be gone.

03:20.300 --> 03:23.230
You no longer have any purpose.

03:23.230 --> 03:25.170
You have lost.

03:25.730 --> 03:27.860
I'll let you go this time.

03:32.340 --> 03:34.830
Tamaki, take everyone and run.

03:40.480 --> 03:44.210
I'll go after him and protect the sword.

03:46.420 --> 03:47.450
Takuma!

03:50.830 --> 03:52.450
Go, Tamaki!

03:53.760 --> 03:56.160
Go after Takuma.

03:57.070 --> 03:58.730
Mahiro.

03:59.430 --> 04:01.630
We'll hold them off here.

04:02.100 --> 04:03.800
So don't worry.

04:04.570 --> 04:07.300
He needs you right now.

04:08.880 --> 04:12.810
It's as Atori says.

04:13.620 --> 04:15.740
I'll leave Onizaki to you.

04:16.680 --> 04:18.240
Suguru...

04:18.720 --> 04:21.390
We will stop them.

04:21.390 --> 04:24.360
Tamaki, we leave everything else to you.

04:24.360 --> 04:27.490
Shinji, Yuichi...

04:33.770 --> 04:35.400
I understand.

04:35.740 --> 04:39.110
Please make sure you come back.

04:39.110 --> 04:40.740
I...

04:40.740 --> 04:46.180
We've come to like you...

04:46.780 --> 04:48.180
Go, quickly.

04:50.050 --> 04:51.040
Okay.

04:56.890 --> 05:00.520
Do you want to lose your soul that badly?

05:01.660 --> 05:02.900
Shut up!

05:02.900 --> 05:05.270
Don't underestimate me.

05:05.270 --> 05:07.340
Who do you think I am?!

05:07.340 --> 05:10.970
I'm Mahiro Atori!

05:13.070 --> 05:19.250
I'll applaud you for having the strength to stand,

05:19.250 --> 05:22.080
after everything that's been done to you.

05:22.650 --> 05:24.240
Silence, Magician.

05:25.090 --> 05:29.080
I'd like this to be the last time I see that leer of yours!

05:29.760 --> 05:31.930
Choosing to fight,

05:31.930 --> 05:34.300
knowing the difference in our strengths,

05:34.300 --> 05:37.600
isn't just fruitless, it's foolish.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.230
But we can't afford to withdraw!

05:46.540 --> 05:47.600
Appear!

05:49.980 --> 05:51.100
You can't hit me.

05:52.210 --> 05:55.010
You will be the one cut by countless blades.

06:01.320 --> 06:03.060
Burn him, flames!

06:03.060 --> 06:05.790
Lighten. Harden.
Accelerate, accelerate, accelerate!

06:09.060 --> 06:12.970
What do you intend to do with that level of attack?

06:18.370 --> 06:19.200
Shinji!

06:20.540 --> 06:26.610
Even now, you fear the imminent approach of your fateful death.

06:26.910 --> 06:28.150
What'd you say?

06:28.150 --> 06:32.280
Rejoice. I'll free you from that suffering.

06:32.890 --> 06:34.520
Shut up, you scumbag!

06:34.520 --> 06:37.290
You can't tell me when I'll die!

06:46.400 --> 06:47.160
Everyone...

06:54.780 --> 06:57.710
<i>Takuma, where are you?</i>

06:59.250 --> 07:00.980
<i>Where are you, Takuma?</i>

07:02.750 --> 07:05.220
<i>Please tell me.</i>

07:10.430 --> 07:11.320
Takuma!

07:13.690 --> 07:14.590
Takuma!

07:33.450 --> 07:34.510
Takuma!

07:34.620 --> 07:38.790
Oni, you are stronger than this.

07:38.790 --> 07:40.120
This is...

07:49.900 --> 07:52.920
No, Takuma! Don't lose yourself!

07:54.970 --> 08:00.810
If this won't release your strength, then very well.

08:04.610 --> 08:07.180
I'll kill this woman,

08:07.180 --> 08:09.780
and bring your Oni strength to the surface.

08:24.300 --> 08:27.100
That's right. That's the way.

08:27.100 --> 08:28.630
That's the Oni.

08:39.880 --> 08:41.280
Takuma!

08:41.280 --> 08:42.650
I don't like this. I don't like this.

08:42.650 --> 08:45.450
You're the only one who can stop him.

08:46.150 --> 08:48.490
Grandma. And Mitsuru.

08:48.490 --> 08:49.890
What are you doing here?

08:49.890 --> 08:54.850
I sensed Onikirimaru's revival and came here.

08:56.330 --> 08:59.200
But that's still an incomplete form.

08:59.730 --> 09:02.600
He cannot control the Oni within him,

09:02.600 --> 09:04.710
and eventually it will destroy him.

09:04.710 --> 09:05.810
No!

09:05.810 --> 09:08.380
Tamaki, stop Takuma.

09:08.380 --> 09:11.280
You, the Tamayori princess, should be able to.

09:15.820 --> 09:16.720
Okay.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.980
<i>She's right.</i>

09:20.520 --> 09:23.420
<i>If I don't stop Takuma,</i>

09:23.420 --> 09:27.290
<i>then what's the point of everyone else stopping Aria?</i>

09:34.000 --> 09:35.530
Takuma!

09:37.740 --> 09:39.470
Come back, Takuma! Come ba-

09:41.080 --> 09:42.340
Takuma?

09:53.020 --> 09:55.390
<i>A monster is writhing inside my body.</i>

09:55.390 --> 09:57.790
<i>Soon it will wake up.</i>

09:57.790 --> 09:59.590
<i>I won't let it.</i>

09:59.590 --> 10:01.320
<i>I'm the Tamayori princess.</i>

10:08.640 --> 10:11.160
<i>I'll be the Tamayori princess.</i>

10:14.410 --> 10:17.170
Takuma, go back to normal.

10:18.310 --> 10:19.910
Please.

10:26.050 --> 10:27.780
Everyone's waiting.

10:40.970 --> 10:42.230
I got it.

10:43.640 --> 10:46.970
I'm all right now.

10:52.780 --> 10:54.720
Thank you, Tamaki.

10:59.690 --> 11:00.990
Takuma...

11:09.530 --> 11:12.630
Eins, even without becoming an Oni,

11:12.630 --> 11:14.470
I will not lose to you.

11:15.000 --> 11:17.200
I have with me this Tamayori princess,

11:17.200 --> 11:22.140
and friends I've grown up with since I was a kid.

11:23.440 --> 11:25.210
You are weak.

11:25.210 --> 11:30.890
Do you wish to remain among those who are exploited?

11:30.890 --> 11:34.960
No matter what attractive words you use to define your weakness,

11:34.960 --> 11:38.260
in the face of power, you are bound to lose!

11:40.800 --> 11:41.960
Stop it!

11:43.460 --> 11:45.130
Do you want to die?

11:45.130 --> 11:47.830
Please, don't hurt him any more.

11:49.300 --> 11:50.170
Leave.

11:51.010 --> 11:52.770
Leave!

12:29.610 --> 12:33.880
The Onikirimaru has been revived.

12:36.380 --> 12:41.010
The Onikirimaru has been revived.

12:54.140 --> 12:56.070
This is more than I was expecting.

12:57.240 --> 12:58.070
Aria?

13:52.960 --> 13:54.720
What is this?

13:58.100 --> 14:01.230
<i>From a human perspective, we're beasts.</i>

14:02.300 --> 14:06.870
<i>Once the barrier is gone, we'll have served our purpose</i>

14:06.870 --> 14:08.070
<i>and we will be ostracized.</i>

14:12.050 --> 14:14.020
<i>There's an Oni inside me.</i>

14:23.190 --> 14:26.190
<i>The ceremony of sacrifice is upon us.</i>

14:26.190 --> 14:27.460
<i>Mother!</i>

14:29.330 --> 14:30.660
<i>Mother...</i>

15:05.030 --> 15:08.470
So the Artifact has this power as well...

15:58.820 --> 15:59.950
Takuma!

16:21.980 --> 16:24.450
Takuma!

16:36.260 --> 16:37.380
Takuma!

16:48.100 --> 16:50.500
As Tamayori princess, I command you:

16:53.640 --> 16:55.400
Calm yourself!

17:32.050 --> 17:34.310
As you can see,

17:34.650 --> 17:38.380
the Onikirimaru is in the hands of the
Tamayori princess and the Guardian.

17:39.390 --> 17:42.790
Can you oppose this power?

17:46.590 --> 17:48.530
Eins, don't.

17:50.360 --> 17:51.370
But, Monado-

17:51.370 --> 17:55.830
The world is much more interesting than I had expected.

17:57.940 --> 18:00.570
I, the Monado of Logos,

18:00.570 --> 18:04.240
never would have imagined that weaklings like these...

18:04.240 --> 18:06.180
could foil my plans.

18:06.180 --> 18:07.670
Lady Aria...

18:09.220 --> 18:10.410
Let's go.

18:11.720 --> 18:12.710
Yes.

18:54.500 --> 18:55.900
Takuma!

18:58.470 --> 18:59.730
Takuma?

19:02.270 --> 19:03.670
Get it together, Takuma!

19:03.670 --> 19:04.940
Are you all right?

19:04.940 --> 19:06.010
Onizaki.

19:06.010 --> 19:06.770
Upperclassman!

19:12.910 --> 19:14.110
Takuma...

19:16.820 --> 19:19.690
Hey, cut it out. Stop messing around! Open your eyes!

19:19.690 --> 19:21.120
Takuma!

19:24.260 --> 19:25.890
Takuma!

19:38.540 --> 19:39.560
It's all right.

19:40.970 --> 19:43.000
I'm all right.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.610
Takuma...

19:44.610 --> 19:47.010
You idiot. Don't worry us like that!

19:47.510 --> 19:49.010
Got it, upperclassman.

19:50.520 --> 19:52.390
Thank you, Takuma.

19:52.390 --> 19:56.120
You suppressed the
Onikirimaru's strength.

19:56.120 --> 19:57.850
No, it wasn't me.

19:58.560 --> 20:03.030
It was because of you and my seniors, Ohmi, Shinji...

20:03.030 --> 20:04.290
All of you.

20:12.140 --> 20:14.170
Yes. Thank you.

20:14.840 --> 20:16.940
Thank you, everyone.

20:17.080 --> 20:22.210
My, my. Well, it looks like we can rest easy for the moment, too.

20:23.020 --> 20:24.540
It's not over yet.

20:26.320 --> 20:28.520
I won't give up...

20:28.520 --> 20:32.020
until that troublesome sword is gone from this town completely.

20:33.590 --> 20:36.690
That's a different problem.

22:28.380 --> 22:32.840
When I was soaked by the cold rain
Tsumetai ame zubunureni natteta watashi ni

22:30.380 --> 22:32.350
Hey, is this...

22:33.110 --> 22:37.410
You were the only one to reach out your hand
Kimidake ga sono te wo sashinobete kuretanda

22:35.620 --> 22:37.120
What's wrong, Tamaki?

22:37.550 --> 22:42.560
Why are you always
Naze itsumo kimi nandaro

22:37.550 --> 22:41.320
It's just... I've seen this before.

22:41.690 --> 22:44.520
When Onikirimaru's power was released,

22:42.560 --> 22:47.190
The one to support me
Sasaete kureru hito wa

22:44.520 --> 22:47.860
I saw us walking along Kifu village like this.

22:47.190 --> 22:50.130
Each time
Sono tabi

22:49.360 --> 22:51.160
Was that a vision?

22:50.130 --> 22:54.100
I fall deeper in love
Mata suki ni natteiku

22:52.070 --> 22:53.300
I see.

22:54.300 --> 22:59.200
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you
Ne nani shitemo kimi ni aitaku naruyo

22:54.300 --> 22:58.170
So this is what you saw then.

22:58.170 --> 22:59.200
Yes.

22:59.510 --> 23:04.210
Falling in love hurts
Suki ni narutte kurushiindane

23:00.810 --> 23:03.810
I'm glad that I can walk like this with everyone again.

23:04.210 --> 23:09.170
You are always the only reason I feel happiness and heartache
Ureshiku naru no mo setsunaku saserunomo

23:09.380 --> 23:17.380
I am thinking of you
Itsudemo riyu wa kimi dake dayo

23:20.330 --> 23:28.900
Hey I want to see you
Ima kimi wo omotteruyo

23:23.030 --> 23:24.530
Okay, let's go.

23:25.530 --> 23:26.530
Yeah!

23:32.670 --> 23:34.230
Thanks for everything.

23:35.110 --> 23:39.510
I'm glad you were always there to look out for us.

23:40.180 --> 23:44.240
I've taken to heart all of your wishes and feelings.

23:45.020 --> 23:48.390
I'm sure we'll meet again soon, right?

23:49.460 --> 23:52.650
I won't let you go.

23:53.630 --> 23:57.690
Don't forget that I'll always protect you.
